    <!-- STEP 4 -->
    <article class="step p2" id="s4">
      <div class="step-h"><div class="n">4</div><div><h2>Verwachte schadebedragen</h2><p>Blootstelling × schadecurve: schade per bui en verwachte schade per jaar.</p></div><button class="info" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="s4" title="Toon het rekenproces"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.5"/><path d="M12 11v6M12 7.5v.01"/></svg><span>Rekenproces</span></button></div>
      <div class="ipo">
        <div class="col in"><div class="col-t">Input</div>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text2)">h(T) uit stap 1 en D(h) uit stap 3.</p>
          <div class="f"><label for="t0">Lichtste bui zonder schade (1× per … jaar)</label><span class="val" id="t0v"></span><input type="range" id="t0" min="10" max="90" step="5" value="50"></div>
